 bg-amber-400/15 text-amber-300\">Automation</span></span></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">Build a fully automated monetization funnel with hot-cold isolation architecture for a zero-customer-service, low-maintenance passive income pipeline.</p><span class=\"mt-3 inline-block text-xs text-zinc-500 transition-colors group-hover:text-zinc-300\">Read more →</span></a></article><article style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 p-6 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:border-zinc-700 hover:bg-zinc-900/70 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-zinc-900/50 border-l-blue-400 border-l-2\" href=\"/log/nonlinear-parallax-framer\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">Nonlinear Parallax: Framer Motion Deep Dive</h2></div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-3\"><time class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">2025-04-10</time><span class=\"flex gap-1.5\"><span class=\"rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-blue-400/15 text-blue-300\">Frontend</span><span class=\"rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-blue-400/15 text-blue-300\">Animation</span></span></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">From mathematical principles to engineering implementation, break down the interpolation and variable speed curves behind high-performance parallax scrolling.</p><span class=\"mt-3 inline-block text-xs text-zinc-500 transition-colors group-hover:text-zinc-300\">Read more →</span></a></article><article style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 p-6 backdrop-blur-md transition-